WEBVTT

00:00:01.633 --> 00:00:04.602
The sidebar holds every section

00:00:04.602 --> 00:00:08.112
Assistants: create, edit and test agents

00:00:08.112 --> 00:00:11.705
Workflows: chain calls, messages and waits

00:00:11.705 --> 00:00:15.323
Logs: every call and chat, with transcripts

00:00:15.323 --> 00:00:18.920
Campaigns: call a list of contacts

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.605
Analytics: volume, connectivity and cost

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:26.204
Alerts: get notified when a metric crosses a line

00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:29.800
Knowledge base: documents agents look up

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.387
Numbers: buy, import and pool numbers

00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:36.970
Tools: shared tools and integrations

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.273
Settings: members, API key and billing

00:00:39.273 --> 00:00:45.088
Search (Cmd+K) jumps to any page, agent or campaign
